  {
   "id": "el86",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 24,
   "y": 805,
   "width": 953.7,
   "height": 127.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 302970102,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1676585679,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. Every token makes 3 vectors:\n     Q = Query: what am I looking for?    K = Key: what do I contain?    V = Value: what do I pass on?\n2. Compare the Query of \"is\" with every Key \u2192 a match score for each token.\n3. Softmax turns the scores into weights that add up to 100%.\n4. New \"is\" = 50% \u00d7 V(India) + 30% \u00d7 V(capital) + 10% \u00d7 V(is) + 5% \u00d7 V(The) + 5% \u00d7 V(of)\n     \u2192 \"is\" now carries the meaning \"we're asking for India's capital\".",
   "originalText": "1. Every token makes 3 vectors:\n     Q = Query: what am I looking for?    K = Key: what do I contain?    V = Value: what do I pass on?\n2. Compare the Query of \"is\" with every Key \u2192 a match score for each token.\n3. Softmax turns the scores into weights that add up to 100%.\n4. New \"is\" = 50% \u00d7 V(India) + 30% \u00d7 V(capital) + 10% \u00d7 V(is) + 5% \u00d7 V(The) + 5% \u00d7 V(of)\n     \u2192 \"is\" now carries the meaning \"we're asking for India's capital\".",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "el87",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 24,
   "y": 965,
   "width": 730.4000000000001,
   "height": 40.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#868e96",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 127515854,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1429771988,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A token can only look back at earlier tokens, never ahead.\nMany attention \"heads\" run side by side, each looking for a different kind of link.",
   "originalText": "A token can only look back at earlier tokens, never ahead.\nMany attention \"heads\" run side by side, each looking for a different kind of link.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
